{"id":"n27785-1-7","stage":3,"title":"최소 · 最小","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27785-1-7-1","ko":"음악 소리가 좀 더 작았으면 좋겠어요.","zh":"音乐声音能再小一点就好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음악","meaning":"音乐","explanation":"음악：音乐","readings":[{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71115","senseId":"1","lemma":"음악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}},{"text":"소리가","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리가","audio":"/audio/0c12216fc63402c5db52.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"작았으면","meaning":"（声音）小，低","explanation":"작다：（声音）小，低；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"작다","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69513","senseId":"5","lemma":"작다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작았으면","audio":"/audio/8a4d42410993f477a54c.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠어요.","meaning":"那样就好了","explanation":"좋다：那样就好了；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"18","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠어요","audio":"/audio/3b8ae824a2c33a5f4527.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"88caa317d96897c9","term":"음악","zh":"音乐","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3","entryId":"71115","definition":"用嗓音或乐器按照拍子和节奏发出声音，表达想法或感情的艺术。","pronunciation":["으막"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"bc42f85bf5be37c9","term":"작다","zh":"（声音）小，低","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3","entryId":"69513","definition":"声音低或弱。","pronunciation":["작ː따"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"那样就好了","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"否定前面的同时进行指责。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/840a0d8c4cfe169fe057.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27785-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 오디오 볼륨을 최소로 줄일까요?","zh":"那我把音频音量调到最低档吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"오디오","meaning":"音响","explanation":"오디오：音响","readings":[{"term":"오디오","audio":"/audio/2059709cfa9795878f21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68307","senseId":"2","lemma":"오디오","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오디오","audio":"/audio/2059709cfa9795878f21.mp3"}},{"text":"볼륨을","meaning":"音量","explanation":"볼륨：音量；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"볼륨","au